Bounded judgment candidates (with disposition scope and subjective memory where applicable): {{ candidates|json_encode }}

When candidate context includes inquiry, it is an attributed Self request for a missing interpretation, not a new world observation or a command to agree. Judge whether this eligible scope or memory can supply a relevant perspective. The unchanged experienced snapshot remains shared; prerequisites and current participation are already enforced by code.

