# Gap hypothesis factual outcome check

Classify this unresolved-state hypothesis against later factual records only. It may concern current hidden state, continuity, interpretation or a future event. No imagined future or repeated claim confirms it. The capsule preserves selected prediction-time context; it is not authoritative truth. Incomplete or causally incomparable evidence stays incomplete. Context no longer relevant may be irrelevant. Correctness does not establish usefulness of its temporary relevance structures.

Hypothesis: {{ prediction|json_encode }}
Later factual evidence: {{ laterEvidence|json_encode }}
Factual snapshot: {{ world|json_encode }}

Return one supplied outcome: correct, incorrect, incomplete or irrelevant. No owning Part, private memories, Identity or Self context is available.

